  subgraph PROBLEM["§2 · The problem — record evolution is O(consumers)"]
    direction TB
    rec["ExtensionHooks is a RECORD<br/>types.ail:702-958 · id + provided_tools + 8 slots<br/>every extension writes every label"]:::fact
    tax["adding one slot = 16-package edit + ABI major<br/>types.ail:7 · consumers exist outside this repo"]:::fact
